{"version":1,"content":"<p>今日晚間，英偉達官方宣佈即日起恢復黃仁勳公司總裁、行政總裁及董事會成員職務。董事會表示，經多輪溝通，認可其坦誠態度與領導能力，並在聽取美國政府高層意見後，確信其復職不存在國家安全風險。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587694.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T16:38:02.050892+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":97,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T16:18:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T16:31:15.130533+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T16:31:15.130533+00:00","content_hash":"1cfac321827f1d3185c6ce4fa0e969fc22b28376efe69b7d3eddbbe88bb51a31","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}